.TH MILLE 6.SH NAMEmille \- Mille Bornes.SH SYNOPSIS\fBmille\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONThe French card game of motoring, against the computer.  Your hand is onthe left, numbered; the table shows each side's battle, speed and mileagepiles; the score is on the right.  One letter commands:.TP 12\fBp\fRpick up a card..TP 12\fBu\fI n\fRuse card\fIn\fR.\fR.TP 12\fBd\fI n\fRdiscard card\fIn\fR.\fR.TP 12\fBo\fRput your hand in order..TP 12\fBw\fRtoggle the window..TP 12\fBr\fRredraw the screen..TP 12\fBs\fRsave the game..TP 12\fBq\fRquit..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR